# Optional local overrides. Never commit real credentials.
#
# The isolated Cloudflare relay endpoint. Milestone 1 targets draft 16.
# MOQ_RELAY_URL=https://draft-16.cloudflare.mediaoverquic.com
#
# A Cloudflare-provisioned token with publish and subscribe operations. Create
# it with a short expiry for the demo, then store it only as a Worker secret:
# `wrangler secret put MOQ_RELAY_TOKEN`. Without it the application reports a
# blocking relay-credential state and does not attempt WebTransport.
# MOQ_RELAY_TOKEN=replace-with-the-provisioned-token
